^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-04-02 00:00] observe — four custom requests were declared in a client type map without equivalent server evidence.
 >>[2026-04-02 00:00] decide — earlier planning treated declaration as a mandate and editor parity as a goal.
 >>[2026-07-20 15:20] revise — audit declaration, configuration, invocation, observation, and tests first; mounted-consumer behavior and failure evidence now precede implementation.
 >>[2026-07-20 19:26] revise — add a canonical custom-protocol registry before new requests; routing, advertisement, typing, invocation, observation, and testing are separate evidence states.
 >>[2026-07-20 19:27] decide — future topography and differential requests transport Seed-owned exact coordinates and verified plans; garden, pulse, and hydration methods remain unearned until read-only payloads prove useful.
 >>[2026-07-21] observe — seed form-geometry/pulse land; formContext proposed as next earned custom method after registry.
 >>[2026-07-21] decide — prefer implementing spw/formContext (with tests) over reopening phantom resonance/frequency unless a surface hard-requires them; do not type formContext in client until server handler exists.
}

